  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Uttan known for?",
      "answer": "Uttan is known for its scenic beaches (Uttan, Pali and Dongri), traditional Koli fishing villages, the East Indian Catholic community, beach resorts and weekend getaways, churches like Our Lady of the Sea, and a quiet, semi-rural coastal character at the northwestern tip of Mira-Bhayandar."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Uttan?",
      "answer": "Uttan comes under pin code 401106, which covers the Uttan, Pali, Dongri, Chowk and Tarodi village belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Uttan?",
      "answer": "The main pockets within Uttan are Uttan Village, Pali, Dongri, Chowk, Tarodi and the Uttan-Bhayandar road belt that connects to the rest of Mira-Bhayandar."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Uttan?",
      "answer": "Property in Uttan is largely village homes, bungalows, NA plots and a few newer projects. Indicative rates range from ₹40-60 lakh for a 1BHK in newer buildings to ₹70 lakh-1.3 Cr for independent houses and sea-facing plots, with weekend villas commanding a premium (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Uttan?",
      "answer": "Uttan has no railway station of its own - the nearest is Bhayandar (about 7-9 km), reached by MBMC buses, autos and share autos via the Uttan-Bhayandar road. From Bhayandar, the Western Railway connects to the rest of Mumbai."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near Uttan?",
      "answer": "Uttan has local clinics and small nursing homes, while major hospitals like Jaslok and Apex (Bhayandar) and Bhaktivedanta and Wockhardt (Mira Road) are the nearest large facilities."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which beaches are in Uttan?",
      "answer": "Uttan is home to Uttan Beach, Pali Beach and Dongri Beach - relatively quiet, scenic beaches popular for weekend getaways, beach resorts and film shoots."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best seafood restaurants in Uttan?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Uttan listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
